   },
   "evidence": "HEAD adds `if (mode === \"truncated body\") expect(stderr).toContain(\"ECONNRESET\");`; base has neither this assertion nor the truncated-body cases. All preceding assertions passed, establishing exit 75, elapsed time at least the budget, requests received, no binary execution, and a last-failure diagnostic. The false failure reproduced even on macOS; Linux CI itself was not available for verification. The workflow uses ubuntu-latest with Bun 1.4.2. This is an actively failing test assertion, rather than merely missing or weak coverage."
